W1 finding 2 (hypothesis): snapshot-interval (an integer option) belongs to
the group "daemongroup"; "d-snapshot-interval" is the shortest alias. GOption
resolves it and fails to parse "abc" as an integer ("Cannot parse integer
value"), where an unresolved name would be reported as an unknown option.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/mydumper.cnf --host mysql --user e2e --password e2e-password --database app
lint: MDL403
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: nonzero
expect stderr-contains: Cannot parse integer value
expect stderr-lacks: Unknown option
expect connected: false
-- mydumper.cnf --
[mydumper]
d-snapshot-interval=abc
